OL,3,ANo risk to public from hoax school bomb
OL,4,Athreats, says government minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpecialist cyber-crime officers are
OL,7,Fworking to identify the source of the
OL,8,Fmessages, which were sent to both
OL,9,Fprimary and secondary schools.
